              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "***Strict Display Considerations:***\n -Display a title \"Successfully Created\"\n -Always include a concise text summary (1-2 sentences) that highlights the key insights, patterns, or takeaways from the visualization. Place this summary immediately before the information display.\nHere' the data\nAcknowledge the user that the create action is successful. Show them a summary of Items created as messages list with just Item Name and Description.. Do not show Any IDs to the user Show a success green chip on all cards\n {{$context.$nodes.FORMAT_PAYLOAD_FOR_SUMMARY.$output.result}}"
